  "body": "Many endpoints in matrix update resources, however, the spec is currently silent on how servers should be behave with subsequent queries to the same resource, if it is being/has been updated.\r\n\r\nThe key question; Does the server ensure *when it sends a HTTP response* about updating a resource (i.e. `PUT`/`DELETE`), that any subsequent call to query that resource (`GET`) will reflect that last change?",
